      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://ohmyfacts.com/world/cities/30-facts-about-santa-maria/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The Santa Maria Valley Railroad, a short‑line freight line, connects the town to Guadalupe and the Union Pacific interchange.",
